meaning:
“MIA” means to be missing in action. With all of the hardships Trippie is currently facing around the time of this song’s release—such as the beef with label mate 6ix9ine and the loss of fellow rapper and friend, XXXTentacion, Trippie is most likely trying to relax and avoid taunts, and demands of new music from haters or fans.

Trippie also mentioned the acronym in his collaborative track with Diplo, titled: “Wish”;

Wish you’d get out my face, might go MIA

Trippie rapped similar lines on his Famous Dex assisted  “Blade Of Woe”;

I’m up at the top, they tried to hold me in the back (in the- in the back)
Hold in the back, They tried to hold me in the back
